  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Combine tomato sauce, cider vinegar, curry powder, paprika, sugar, cayenne pepper, salt, and pepper together in a saucepan over medium heat; cook, stirring occasionally, until sauce is warmed and smooth, 5 to 10 minutes.",
